main#contact.recruitmentApplicationPage
    .topContainer
        .topKvPanel
            .topKv
                img.switch(src=(root_path || '') + "image/contact/top_kv_pc.png" alt="")
        .topTitlePanel
            h1 採用応募
            .txt
                p なごや遊花幼稚園への園見学・資料請求・面接のご希望を受け付けています。<br>必要事項をご入力のうえ、確認画面へお進みください。
    .arrow
        img(src=(root_path || '') + "image/contact/top_arrow.png" alt="")
    .contactContainer
        .contactPanel
            .contactItemBox
                .formBox.recruitmentApplicationForm
                    .mw_wp_form.mw_wp_form_input
                        form(data-preview="true" onsubmit="return false")
                            include ../includes/recruitment-application-form.html
